{"id":"139c4bab72fb77d9","group":"14","path":"14/14-ex-sheaf-epimorphism-without-global-lift.md","title":"Example — 层满态射可以没有全局截面原像","display":"Example — 层满态射可以没有全局截面原像","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-ex-sheaf-epimorphism-without-global-lift","aliases":["14-ex-sheaf-epimorphism-without-global-lift"],"display":"Example — 层满态射可以没有全局截面原像","source_ref":"II.4–6, pp.79–95; III.7, Corollary 5, pp.143–144 (local reconstructed example)","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","[[14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf]]","[[14-df-topological-open-site]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-ex-sheaf-epimorphism-without-global-lift"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-ex-sheaf-epimorphism-without-global-lift</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Example — 层满态射可以没有全局截面原像"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"II.4–6, pp.79–95; III.7, Corollary 5, pp.143–144 (local reconstructed example)"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93ae791420c1822a\" href=\"?note=93ae791420c1822a\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective\">14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"14008e4af86a6831\" href=\"?note=14008e4af86a6831\" title=\"14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf\">14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3a8105e59309bc16\" href=\"?note=3a8105e59309bc16\" title=\"14-df-topological-open-site\">14-df-topological-open-site</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_X\">\\(\\tau_X\\)</span> 表示下述空间的通常拓扑。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=S^1=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|=1\\}\">\\(X=S^1=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|=1\\}\\)</span> 取通常拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathbb R\\to S^1\">\\(p:\\mathbb R\\to S^1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(t)=e^{2\\pi it}\">\\(p(t)=e^{2\\pi it}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(U)\">\\(F(U)\\)</span> 是所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}_U\">\\(p\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}_U\\)</span> 的连续函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:U\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(s:U\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>，限制为函数限制；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 为终层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:F\\to1\">\\(q:F\\to1\\)</span> 为唯一态射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(U,\\mathbb R)\">\\(C(U,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> 简写 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"14008e4af86a6831\" href=\"?note=14008e4af86a6831\" title=\"14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf\">14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf</a> 中通常实数目标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathbb R}(U)\">\\(C_{\\mathbb R}(U)\\)</span>；该原子通过连续性谓词定义其函数集合。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*=\\varnothing\">\\(*=\\varnothing\\)</span>。终层的值与限制满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1(U)=\\{*\\}\">\\(1(U)=\\{*\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^U_{1,V}=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{*\\}}\">\\(\\rho^U_{1,V}=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{*\\}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}_X\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TNat}_X\">\\(\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a>，满态射判别使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"93ae791420c1822a\" href=\"?note=93ae791420c1822a\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective\">14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective</a> 的层范畴环境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(U)=\\{s:U\\to\\mathbb R\\mid s\\in C(U,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall z\\in U\\;e^{2\\pi i s(z)}=z\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(U)=\\{s:U\\to\\mathbb R\\mid s\\in C(U,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall z\\in U\\;e^{2\\pi i s(z)}=z\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho^U_V(s)=s|_V\\qquad(V\\subseteq U\\in\\tau_X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho^U_V(s)=s|_V\\qquad(V\\subseteq U\\in\\tau_X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsSheaf}(F,X,\\tau_X),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}(q),\\qquad F(X)=\\varnothing,\\qquad q_X:F(X)\\to\\{*\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsSheaf}(F,X,\\tau_X),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}(q),\\qquad F(X)=\\varnothing,\\qquad q_X:F(X)\\to\\{*\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q:=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(F,1,((s\\mapsto *))_{U\\in\\tau_X}\\right),\\qquad q\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q:=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(F,1,((s\\mapsto *))_{U\\in\\tau_X}\\right),\\qquad q\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>局部连续函数的相容族唯一粘合，且方程 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(p\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span> 是局部条件，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是层。每点有足够小的开弧，其上存在连续对数分支；因此终层截面局部总有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的原像。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b:1\\to H\">\\(a,b:1\\to H\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"aq=bq\">\\(aq=bq\\)</span>，限制到这些开弧后相等，再由层的分离性得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=b\">\\(a=b\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 满。若全局 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 存在，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\mapsto s(e^{2\\pi it})-t\">\\(t\\mapsto s(e^{2\\pi it})-t\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span> 上整数值连续函数，必常值；其端点值却相差 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(1)\">\\(s(1)\\)</span> 两次取同值，矛盾。本例说明为何层满态射要用局部满射或茎满射判别。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，II.4–6, pp.79–95; III.7, Corollary 5, pp.143–144 (local reconstructed example)。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective","status":"resolved","id":"93ae791420c1822a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"14008e4af86a6831","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-open-site","status":"resolved","id":"3a8105e59309bc16","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-open-site]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"14008e4af86a6831","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_X$ 表示下述空间的通常拓扑。$X=S^1=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|=1\\}$ 取通常拓扑，$p:\\mathbb R\\to S^1$，$p(t)=e^{2\\pi it}$。$F(U)$ 是所有满足 $p\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}_U$ 的连续函数 $s:U\\to\\mathbb R$，限制为函数限制；$1$ 为终层，$q:F\\to1$ 为唯一态射。$C(U,\\mathbb R)$ 简写 [[14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf]] 中通常实数目标的 $C_{\\mathbb R}(U)$；该原子通过连续性谓词定义其函数集合。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"令 $*=\\varnothing$。终层的值与限制满足 $1(U)=\\{*\\}$、$\\rho^U_{1,V}=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{*\\}}$；$\\mathrm{Nat}_X$ 与 $\\operatorname{TNat}_X$ 采用 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]，满态射判别使用 [[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]] 的层范畴环境。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective","status":"resolved","id":"93ae791420c1822a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"令 $*=\\varnothing$。终层的值与限制满足 $1(U)=\\{*\\}$、$\\rho^U_{1,V}=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{*\\}}$；$\\mathrm{Nat}_X$ 与 $\\operatorname{TNat}_X$ 采用 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]，满态射判别使用 [[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]] 的层范畴环境。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau_X","display":false},{"tex":"X=S^1=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathbb R\\to S^1","display":false},{"tex":"p(t)=e^{2\\pi it}","display":false},{"tex":"F(U)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}_U","display":false},{"tex":"s:U\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"q:F\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"C(U,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\mathbb R}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"*=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"1(U)=\\{*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho^U_{1,V}=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{*\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nat}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TNat}_X","display":false},{"tex":"F(U)=\\{s:U\\to\\mathbb R\\mid s\\in C(U,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall z\\in U\\;e^{2\\pi i s(z)}=z\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho^U_V(s)=s|_V\\qquad(V\\subseteq U\\in\\tau_X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsSheaf}(F,X,\\tau_X),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}(q),\\qquad F(X)=\\varnothing,\\qquad q_X:F(X)\\to\\{*\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"q:=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(F,1,((s\\mapsto *))_{U\\in\\tau_X}\\right),\\qquad q\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,1).","display":true},{"tex":"p\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"a,b:1\\to H","display":false},{"tex":"aq=bq","display":false},{"tex":"a=b","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"t\\mapsto s(e^{2\\pi it})-t","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"s(1)","display":false}],"bytes":2914,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sheaf-epimorphism-without-global-lift|ex-206 — 层满态射可以没有全局截面原像]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sheaf-epimorphism-without-global-lift]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-199","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sheaf-epimorphism-without-global-lift]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sheaf-epimorphism-without-global-lift]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sheaf-epimorphism-without-global-lift|ex-206 — 层满态射可以没有全局截面原像]]"}],"outgoing":["93ae791420c1822a","83765a3303e549f5","f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","14008e4af86a6831","3a8105e59309bc16"]}